  "bodyHash": "cf76c0149bbc2498",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">災厄入侵將 Minecraft 的災厄村民提升到全新境界！近十種擁有獨特能力的新災厄村民現在正遊蕩在你的世界中。有些隱藏在危險的新結構中，有些則會加入村莊襲擊，讓挑戰更加艱鉅。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對抗更聰明的敵人、尋找強大的戰利品，並探索秘密地點。新的挑戰意味著新的獎勵&mdash;&mdash;沿途充滿無限樂趣！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 全新災厄村民</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鍊金術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：擅長射箭的專家，受到挑釁時會丟擲滯留藥水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">書記官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：為周圍的災厄村民施加附魔增益。受驚時會逃跑並施放法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猛擊者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：手持巨盾的惡霸，會直接衝撞玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：遠程災厄村民，會投擲致命的戰斧&mdash;&mdash;從他身上取得</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鉑金灌注戰斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">吧！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">挑釁者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用弓箭的災厄村民，掌握基礎增益法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">術士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：神出鬼沒的法師，會召喚危險的紫色火焰。掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">異樣塵埃</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死靈法師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：亡者之主，透過召喚法術壓垮玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">審判者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：擁有強大盾牌的威猛戰士&mdash;&mdash;先打破他的盾牌才能擊敗他！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">呼火者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：看似無害的神秘法師&mdash;&mdash;直到他釋放出毀滅性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">祈喚者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：最強大的災厄村民！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神聖寶石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，用於搭配</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注桌</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">升級附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：現已加入生存模式並換上新外觀！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻象塵埃</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 全新結構</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">呼火者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：帶有農場的小房子。發現於惡地生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">災厄要塞</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：設有圍牆、塔樓與強力災厄村民的防禦前哨。發現於針葉林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻術師塔樓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：多層高塔，內藏大量災厄村民，頂部會有幻術師戰鬥。發現於針葉林與深色森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷宮</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：龐大的地下迷宮，充滿豐富戰利品與更多災厄村民。尋找石廟入口！發現於多數森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">術士小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：小型房屋結構。發現於深色森林生物群系。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ 全新裝備與物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注桌</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：突破常規限制升級附魔！每次使用需消耗一顆</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神聖寶石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鉑金灌注戰斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：類戰斧的投擲武器，僅有掠奪者稀有掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">尋礦蠟燭</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：透過揭示位置來幫助定位附近的礦脈。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">顯形號角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使附近怪物發光，讓你更快發現他們！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器均需安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援設定，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行配置（Fabric 版需安裝由</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發的</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需額外安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若欲使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料夾內，檔名分別為</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，依配置類型而定。並非所有模組都會包含全部類型。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感謝</span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最初開發了精彩的災厄擴充模組。災厄入侵忠實延續了他的作品，並加入了許多新增內容、改進、重做與錯誤修復。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fZekeSmith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在原始碼被 Dricky 刪除後找回原版災厄擴充的來源，使得本移植版得以在</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspdx.org%252flicenses%252fMIT.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">授權條款下進行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">致力於 1.19.2 版本的災厄擴充模組，「顯形號角」的紋理即取自該版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">創作眾多精美的新紋理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
